content:
Yesterday we saw how the lamb, the ram, and the young bull picture our growth from salvation, to consecration, to complete surrender. Today let us look more closely at the measurements themselves, for there is a lesson hidden in the exact amounts of flour, oil, and wine that Yahweh commanded. Before we say a single word about them, let us simply place the three offerings side by side, and see the pattern with our own eyes.

